    <string name="onboarding_title">AI Shield</string>
    <string name="onboarding_subtitle">Real-time detection of AI-generated content while you browse social media. No screenshots. No uploads. Silent protection.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_bullets">•  Works with Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, X, Reddit, YouTube and more\n•  Detects AI images, deepfakes and synthetic audio\n•  Only interrupts you when confidence is high (e.g. "Likely AI - 94%")\n•  Thresholds tuned remotely - no app updates needed\n•  Analysis runs on your device</string>
